      "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes #58127.\n\n`DelegatingParser` marks reasoning ended when Hunyuan enters the answer section, so later deltas were passthrough and leaked `\\n</answer>`. Opt-in `post_reasoning_stream_filter` keeps those deltas on the Hunyuan state machine so the closing marker is stripped, matching non-streaming.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `PYTHONPATH=. python3 -m pytest tests/reasoning/test_hunyuan_reasoning_parser.py -q --noconftest` (18 passed)\n- [x] `ruff check` / `ruff format --check` on touched files",
